The main repository for code related to our MAPF research.

mapf-common/ contains common MAPF data structures and functions used throughout the repositories.
mapf-solvers/ contains the traditional solvers used throughout our research as a library.
mapf-benchmark/ contains the benchmarking framework used to generate data.
mapf-dallas/ contains our novel meta-solver implementation.
mapf-meta-solver/ contains a baseline meta-solver implementation.

For certain projects to build, please install the onnxruntime into external/onnxruntime/. By default, this is where the build expects it.
The latest release can be found here: https://github.com/microsoft/onnxruntime/releases/.